{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/989325-fiction-on-seekings","id":989325,"title":"Fiction on Seekings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-18T06:48:56-07:00","id":989325,"title":"Fiction on Seekings","content":"After years of being a Vampire fan I'm finally getting into Mage. Seekings are one of my favorite elements. Are there any books that feature fiction on them besides The Book of Shadows?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T14:13:40-07:00","id":989535,"title":"","content":"One of the short stories in <u>Truth Beyond Paradox</u> features a really cool Seeking. Can't remember which one exactly, but it features a street performer IIRC. Actually, the whole book is probably the best Mage fiction out there, and while that's not really a high bar to overcome, I really enjoyed reading it. It was recently published for M20.<br /> <br /> However, don't be fooled by <u>Truth Until Paradox</u>. Mind that middle word. You want &quot;Beyond.&quot; &quot;Until&quot; is much older, and had a couple of ok stories, but many of them fell short of either &quot;good&quot; or an accurate understanding of the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6384-frozenfishy","name":"Frozenfishy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T19:38:55-07:00","id":989673,"title":"","content":"One of the best examples of a &quot;seeking&quot; was outside the game line, in an episode of Community called Virtual Systems Analysis (s3 e16). I'm not sure the writers have even heard of the game, but it's spot on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T20:15:41-07:00","id":989686,"title":"","content":"The Adventure Time episode: Hall of Egress<br /> This one isn't done strictly as a Seeking. But it works very well as one. The main character is basically stuck in a room with a metaphysical puzzle to solve. Trying to solve it with the methods he's used to only even ends in defeat. But once he gives up what's familiar and embarrasses intuition and the unknown, he passes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https: